        "f9d62ed6-0bb5-4a76-9bc9-5abec51c97cc": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Our Clean Ingredients",
            "content": "<p>Water, Alcohol,<br\/>Glycerin, Butylene Glycol,<br\/>Sorbitan Oleate Decylglucoside<br\/>Crosspolymer, Dextran,<br\/>Niacinamide, Caffeine, Acetyl<br\/>Tetrapeptide-3, Trifolium<br\/>Pratense (Clover) Flower Extract,<br\/>Panthenol (Vitamin B5), Malus<br\/>Domestica Fruit Cell Culture<br\/>Extract, Xanthan Gum, Lecithin,<br\/>Polysorbate-20, Sodium<br\/>Benzoate, Citric Acid,<br\/>Sodium Citrate.<\/p>",
            "liquid": "",
            "default_open": false
          }
        },
        "f3572860-3133-443b-8acf-81054f33e5e5": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What Makes Us Different",
            "content": "<p>Unveil No.3 is the first anti-shedding, anti-breakage, thickening serum, for a fuller thicker head of hair. Now you can grow your hair and keep it. <\/p><p>Non-Toxic | Vegan | Gluten-Free | Cruelty-Free | Fragrance-Free | No Known Carcinogens <\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>Subscribe:<\/strong> Receive <strong>3 bottles<\/strong> every <strong>3 months<\/strong> and get <em>$21 OFF in savings<\/em>!<\/p>",
            "liquid": "",
            "default_open": false
          }
        },
        "0ce531f7-2eb2-4eb8-8130-c32c5466b542": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to apply",
            "content": "<p>Spray 1-2 pumps directly onto your scalp in <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">each<\/span> of your thinning areas. <\/p><p>Massage into your scalp with fingertips. <\/p><p>For best results, use our scalp-stimulating brush before you spray your scalp, to get increased blood flow up to the scalp and clean away any debris. <\/p><p>Use once daily, either AM or PM.  <\/p><p>** This is a Leave-On Treatment**<\/p>",
            "liquid": "",
            "default_open": false
          }
        }
      },
